function|GetFactionLeader|nwn.get_faction_leader|pure|||get_faction_leader||Creatures||Get the player leader of the faction of which oMemberOfFaction is a member. * Returns OBJECT_INVALID if oMemberOfFaction is not a valid creature, or oMemberOfFaction is a member of a NPC faction.|
function|GetFactionLeastDamagedMember|nwn.get_faction_least_damaged_member|pure||bMustBeVisible:Bool|get_faction_least_damaged_member||Creatures||Get the member of oFactionMember's faction that has taken the fewest hit points of damage. * Returns OBJECT_INVALID if oFactionMember's faction is invalid.|
