function|GetFactionStrongestMember|nwn.get_faction_strongest_member|pure||bMustBeVisible:Bool|get_faction_strongest_member||Creatures||Get the strongest member of oFactionMember's faction. * Returns OBJECT_INVALID if oFactionMember's faction is invalid.|
function|GetFactionWeakestMember|nwn.get_faction_weakest_member|pure||bMustBeVisible:Bool|get_faction_weakest_member||Creatures||Get the weakest member of oFactionMember's faction. * Returns OBJECT_INVALID if oFactionMember's faction is invalid.|
function|GetFactionWorstAC|nwn.get_faction_worst_ac|pure||bMustBeVisible:Bool|get_faction_worst_ac||Creatures||Get the object faction member with the lowest armour class. * Returns OBJECT_INVALID if oFactionMember's faction is invalid.|
function|GetFamiliarCreatureType|nwn.get_familiar_creature_type|pure|||get_familiar_creature_type||Creatures||Get oCreature's familiar creature type (FAMILIAR_CREATURE_TYPE_*). * Returns FAMILIAR_CREATURE_TYPE_NONE if oCreature is invalid or does not currently have a familiar.|
function|GetFamiliarName|nwn.get_familiar_name|pure|||get_familiar_name||Objects||Get oCreature's familiar's name. * Returns "" if oCreature is invalid, does not currently have a familiar or if the familiar's name is blank.|
