function|GetFogColor|nwn.get_fog_color|pure|||||Areas and time||Gets the fog color in the area specified. nFogType specifies wether the Sun, or Moon fog type is returned. Valid values for nFogType are FOG_TYPE_SUN or FOG_TYPE_MOON. If no valid area (or object) is specified, it uses the area of caller. If an object other than an area is specified, will use the area that the object is currently in.|
function|GetFortitudeSavingThrow|nwn.get_fortitude_saving_throw|pure|||get_fortitude_saving_throw||Creatures||Get oTarget's base fortitude saving throw value (this will only work for creatures, doors, and placeables). * Returns 0 if oTarget is invalid.|
