function|GetGoodEvilValue|nwn.get_good_evil_value|pure|||get_good_evil_value||Objects||Get an integer between 0 and 100 (inclusive) to represent oCreature's Good/Evil alignment (100=good, 0=evil) * Return value if oCreature is not a valid creature: -1|
function|GetHardness|nwn.get_hardness|pure|||get_hardness||Objects||returns the Hardness of a Door or Placeable object. - oObject: a door or placeable object. returns -1 on an error or if used on an object that is neither a door nor a placeable object.|
function|GetHasFeat|nwn.get_has_feat|pure|Bool|bIgnoreUses:Bool|||Creatures||Determine whether oCreature has nFeat, optionally if nFeat is useable. - nFeat: FEAT_* - oCreature - bIgnoreUses: Will check if the creature has the given feat even if it has no uses remaining|
function|GetHasFeatEffect|nwn.get_has_feat_effect|pure|Bool||||Effects||- nFeat: FEAT_* - oObject * Returns TRUE if oObject has effects on it originating from nFeat.|
