function|GetIsAreaAboveGround|nwn.get_is_area_above_ground|pure|Bool||get_is_area_above_ground||Areas and time||Returns AREA_ABOVEGROUND if the area oArea is above ground, AREA_UNDERGROUND otherwise. Returns AREA_INVALID, on an error.|
