function|GetIsDM|nwn.get_is_dm|pure|Bool||is_dm||Objects||* Returns TRUE if oCreature is the Dungeon Master. Note: This will return FALSE if oCreature is a DM Possessed creature. To determine if oCreature is a DM Possessed creature, use GetIsDMPossessed()|
function|GetIsDMPossessed|nwn.get_is_dm_possessed|pure|Bool||get_is_dm_possessed||Objects||Returns TRUE if the creature oCreature is currently possessed by a DM character. Returns FALSE otherwise. Note: GetIsDMPossessed() will return FALSE if oCreature is the DM character. To determine if oCreature is a DM character use GetIsDM()|
