function|GetIsNight|nwn.get_is_night|pure|Bool||||Objects||* Returns TRUE if it is currently night.|
function|GetIsObjectValid|nwn.get_is_object_valid|pure|Bool||is_valid||Objects||* Returns TRUE if oObject is a valid object.|
function|GetIsOpen|nwn.get_is_open|pure|Bool||get_is_open||Objects||* Returns TRUE if oObject (which is a placeable or a door) is currently open.|
