function|GetItemPossessor|nwn.get_item_possessor|pure||bReturnBags:Bool|get_item_possessor||Items||Get the possessor of oItem - bReturnBags: If TRUE will potentially return a bag container item the item is in, instead of the object holding the bag. Make sure to check the returning item object type with this flag. * Return value on error: OBJECT_INVALID|
function|GetItemStackSize|nwn.get_item_stack_size|pure|||get_item_stack_size||Items||Returns stack size of an item - oItem: item to query|
function|GetLawChaosValue|nwn.get_law_chaos_value|pure|||get_law_chaos_value||Objects||Get an integer between 0 and 100 (inclusive) to represent oCreature's Law/Chaos alignment (100=law, 0=chaos) * Return value if oCreature is not a valid creature: -1|
function|GetLevelByClass|nwn.get_level_by_class|pure|||||Creatures||Determine the levels that oCreature holds in nClassType. - nClassType: CLASS_TYPE_* - oCreature|
function|GetLocalFloat|nwn.get_local_float|pure|||get_local_float||Locals||Get oObject's local float variable sVarName * Return value on error: 0.0f|
function|GetLocalInt|nwn.get_local_int|pure|||get_local_int||Locals||Get oObject's local integer variable sVarName * Return value on error: 0|
function|GetLocalLocation|nwn.get_local_location|pure|Location||get_local_location||Locals||Get oObject's local location variable sVarname|
function|GetLocalObject|nwn.get_local_object|pure|||get_local_object||Locals||Get oObject's local object variable sVarName * Return value on error: OBJECT_INVALID|
function|GetLocalString|nwn.get_local_string|pure|||get_local_string||Locals||Get oObject's local string variable sVarName * Return value on error: ""|
function|GetLocation|nwn.get_location|pure|Location||get_location||Objects||Get the location of oObject.|
function|GetLockKeyRequired|nwn.get_lock_key_required|pure|Bool||get_lock_key_required||Objects||* Returns TRUE if a specific key is required to open the lock on oObject.|
function|GetLockKeyTag|nwn.get_lock_key_tag|pure|||get_lock_key_tag||Objects||Get the tag of the key that will open the lock on oObject.|
function|GetLockLockDC|nwn.get_lock_lock_dc|pure|||get_lock_lock_dc||Objects||Get the DC for locking oObject.|
function|GetLockLockable|nwn.get_lock_lockable|pure|Bool||get_lock_lockable||Objects||* Returns TRUE if the lock on oObject is lockable.|
function|GetLockUnlockDC|nwn.get_lock_unlock_dc|pure|||get_lock_unlock_dc||Objects||Get the DC for unlocking oObject.|
